        "tree_id": "5fcfefeaff7d7477471f1e193e89f28fa80c1ef8",
        "message": "fix the rolling build's publish step\n\nTwo failures in the first run:\n\n- The version step used cut with a backslash-escaped quote that ended up\n  literal in the script, so cut failed and every asset came out as\n  `flipflop--windows-x86_64.zip`. Read it with sed instead, and fail loudly\n  when it comes back empty.\n- `gh release create --target` resolves the tag with git, which needs a\n  checkout; the publish job had none, so the release was never created and the\n  desktop files only existed as Actions artifacts.\n\nAlso list the Windows installer before the portable zip, since that is what\nmost people want.",
